+# WCAG Contrast Audit Map (AA/AAA)
+
+Date: 2026-03-03  
+Scope: public + admin UI color pairs in `frontend/src/styles/vibe.css`
+
+Method:
+- Contrast ratio formula per WCAG 2.1 (relative luminance).
+- Normal text target: AA >= 4.5:1, AAA >= 7:1.
+- Large text target: AA >= 3:1.
+
+## Component Map
+
+| Component / Pair | Foreground | Background | Ratio | Normal Text | Large Text |
+|---|---|---|---:|---|---|
+| Body text | `#111d33` | `#ffffff` | 16.84 | AAA | AA |
+| Muted text | `#445675` | `#ffffff` | 7.41 | AAA | AA |
+| Navbar primary links | `#f5f9ff` | dark nav (`#0a2245` approx) | 14.97 | AAA | AA |
+| Navbar subtitle | `#ebf3ff` | dark nav (`#0a2245` approx) | 14.16 | AAA | AA |
+| Cohort pill text | `#f4faff` | dark nav (`#0a2245` approx) | 15.04 | AAA | AA |
+| Primary CTA text (start) | `#ffffff` | `#cc402e` | 4.84 | AA | AA |
+| Primary CTA text (end) | `#ffffff` | `#b53a28` | 5.83 | AA | AA |
+| Primary CTA text (hover end) | `#ffffff` | `#9f2d20` | 7.32 | AAA | AA |
+| Outline CTA text | `#e6efff` | dark nav (`#0a2245` approx) | 13.67 | AAA | AA |
+| Footer copy/links | `#edf2ff` | footer dark (`#0f2345` approx) | 13.92 | AAA | AA |
+| Footer pill text | `#ffe8bd` | footer dark (`#0f2345` approx) | 13.02 | AAA | AA |
+| Section kicker | `#2a5f9f` | `#f5f8fd` | 6.10 | AA | AA |
+| Home kicker | `#265fa4` | `#ffffff` | 6.45 | AA | AA |
+| Infographic subtitle | `#4a5c7c` | `#ffffff` | 6.75 | AA | AA |
+| Admin nav labels/links | `#eaf1ff` | sidebar (`#132a4e` approx) | 12.61 | AAA | AA |
+| Admin KPI muted text | `#5a6b8c` | `#ffffff` | 5.36 | AA | AA |
+| Admin table head text | `#495a78` | `#f7faff` | 6.65 | AA | AA |
+| Placeholder text | `#617190` | `#ffffff` | 4.91 | AA | AA |
+
+## Tightened Tokens
+
+Updated to eliminate previous borderline/failing CTA combinations:
+- `--color-secondary: #cc402e`
+- `--color-cta-start: #cc402e`
+- `--color-cta-end: #b53a28`
+- `--color-cta-hover-start: #b53a28`
+- `--color-cta-hover-end: #9f2d20`
+
+These are now reused by:
+- Navbar primary CTA
+- Hero CTA
+- Public accent buttons
+- Admin primary buttons
+
+## Notes
+
+- Gradient/overlay components were evaluated with representative dominant background colors for practical UI validation.
+- Motion still respects `prefers-reduced-motion` via global responsive styles.

